    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the collision of the Milky Way and Andromeda Galaxy. Milkdromeda is born, simultaneously reviving an ancient culture known as &quot;Galactic Communion&quot; and scattering fragments of power throughout the stars. You play as either Keaton or his lovable partner, Garden, who become &quot;UltraKin&quot;, a super-powered community of altruists who share and carry out the will of the Galaxy-- A desire in which to provide for and protect all living things! At least that's how it used to be...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981920/extras/af81f13bb046fd016ae73559652abde8.poster.avif?t=1744914834\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981920/extras/af81f13bb046fd016ae73559652abde8.webm?t=1744914834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981920/extras/af81f13bb046fd016ae73559652abde8.mp4?t=1744914834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RACE TO RECOVER ULTRA SHARDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981920/extras/UltraShard.gif?t=1744914834\" width=480 height=270 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect lost fragments of power belonging to the Galaxy against an opportunistic invasion lead by an unknown entity as you provide disaster relief for strife-ridden civilizations along your adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TRAVERSE THE GALAXY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981920/extras/1bd7f709a584162e8e290a74f89e3dae.poster.avif?t=1744914834\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981920/extras/1bd7f709a584162e8e290a74f89e3dae.webm?t=1744914834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981920/extras/1bd7f709a584162e8e290a74f89e3dae.mp4?t=1744914834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Immerse yourself in this captivating narrative as you discover different types of planets and charming characters. Uncover hidden lore and truths about the nature of galaxies and the universe as you save those in need.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MASTER A DIVERSE MOVE SET</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981920/extras/a458658ad70911ba3ad440a4fa0c473c.poster.avif?t=1744914834\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981920/extras/a458658ad70911ba3ad440a4fa0c473c.webm?t=1744914834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981920/extras/a458658ad70911ba3ad440a4fa0c473c.mp4?t=1744914834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move energetically throughout sprawling regions with various abilities at your disposal! Combat enemies, pull off dazzling tricks, and solve puzzles as you gradually gain access to even more mobility options to overcome alien terrain!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>JOIN FORCES IN LOCAL CO-OP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981920/extras/908dd87ba3bb47cb543d7e0489b63d13.poster.avif?t=1744914834\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981920/extras/908dd87ba3bb47cb543d7e0489b63d13.webm?t=1744914834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981920/extras/908dd87ba3bb47cb543d7e0489b63d13.mp4?t=1744914834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dominate the battlefield with another UltraKin! 2 players can\u00a0seamlessly experience the story together. Easily drop in and out of gameplay at the press of a button. You can compete or cooperate for the best score possible!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>COLLECTABLES AND EQUIPMENT COMBINATIONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981920/extras/0b5d02b6effd256462a720dac031fe59.poster.avif?t=1744914834\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981920/extras/0b5d02b6effd256462a720dac031fe59.webm?t=1744914834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981920/extras/0b5d02b6effd256462a720dac031fe59.mp4?t=1744914834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various items exist to aid you on your adventure! Spice up how you like to play by mixing and matching different combinations of stat modifying equipment. Utilize Power ups to navigate difficult situations, and make use of objects in your surroundings to solve problems!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local Co-op</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 Playable Characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Solar Systems to Explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 Planets to Discover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >18 Hand Crafted Regions (Levels)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stat Altering Equipment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss Fights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mini Bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collectables</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Save Files</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse NPCs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charming Dialogue</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Power Ups</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Side Missions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skippable Tutorial</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 Character Movesets\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combo Chains</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More to Come!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the collision of the Milky Way and Andromeda Galaxy. Milkdromeda is born, simultaneously reviving an ancient culture known as &quot;Galactic Communion&quot; and scattering fragments of power throughout the stars. You play as either Keaton or his lovable partner, Garden, who become &quot;UltraKin&quot;, a super-powered community of altruists who share and carry out the will of the Galaxy-- A desire in which to provide for and protect all living things! At least that's how it used to be...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981920/extras/af81f13bb046fd016ae73559652abde8.poster.avif?t=1744914834\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981920/extras/af81f13bb046fd016ae73559652abde8.webm?t=1744914834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981920/extras/af81f13bb046fd016ae73559652abde8.mp4?t=1744914834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RACE TO RECOVER ULTRA SHARDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981920/extras/UltraShard.gif?t=1744914834\" width=480 height=270 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect lost fragments of power belonging to the Galaxy against an opportunistic invasion lead by an unknown entity as you provide disaster relief for strife-ridden civilizations along your adventure!<